E5  Paired statistics (repairs the reporting in Tables 1 and 3)
==============================================================================
  Table 1 reports e.g. 2.5836 +/- 0.0064 against 2.5874 +/- 0.0064: the
  difference is smaller than either error bar, so as printed the result
  is not statistically supported. But the comparison is PAIRED -- same
  instance, same scenarios, same draw -- so the paired interval is the
  correct summary. We report both to show what changes.

